OL,3,GNEWSA'One heck of a rollercoaster' -
OL,4,Afoster carers urged to come forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor almost 24 years, Beverly Craig and
OL,7,Fher husband have had 14 "wee ones" ` or
OL,8,Ffoster children ` through their doors.
OL,10,FAnd despite the "emotional
OL,11,Frollercoaster" of nurturing a child
OL,12,Fdestined to leave sooner rather than
OL,13,Flater, she would not change a thing.
OL,15,F"There isn't one that has come through
OL,16,Four door that my husband and I weren't
OL,17,Fable to love very much and take them
OL,18,Flike our own," she said. "It's just
OL,19,Fbeen a joy."
